      "issue": "SDR reviewer scope",
      "finding": "Crosswalk contains 93 rows, of which 23 claim independent human review; 8 new high-confidence and 4 precedent-accepted rows do not. Do not claim all mappings were independently double-reviewed."
    },
    {
      "issue": "SDR weighting language",
      "finding": "Spearman uses one equally weighted category observation; the descriptive least-squares slope is weighted by All-employed counts. Blanket equal-weight language for both statistics would misdescribe the code."
    },
    {
      "issue": "Machine benchmark provenance",
      "finding": "configuration.json embeds a 231-occupation total versus 303 final instrument occupations. It records 10 usable/12 recorded runs and 1,151 responses but response-level payloads are unavailable. Machine aggregates must remain historical and cannot be represented as recomputed response-level evidence."
    },
